| description = In South Kaladim behind the clerics guild can be found the long hall to the Dwarven [[Paladin]]s.  
Called the [[Paladins of Underfoot]] as well as Miners Guild 249, the Paladins under the direction of [[Datur Nightseer]] support the Dwarven [[King Kazon Stormhammer]]
and the [[Clerics of Underfoot]].  Those people wishing to support the clerics and palidins of underfoot can improve their standing with both guilds by turning in 
[[Bone Chips]] four at a time in their battle against the undead.

